    <item>
      <title>威廉·劳伦斯在战场密歇根州众议院区初选获胜</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/politics/maasdam-lawrence-michigan-primary.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[威廉·劳伦斯击败了两名温和派候选人，挑战了弱势的共和党现任议员，但一些人担心他的观点可能会损害他在 11 月份的机会。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/politics/maasdam-lawrence-michigan-primary.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 06:52:43 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普和珍妮·皮罗在椭圆形办公室的对决</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/politics/trump-jeanine-pirro-showdown.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[哥伦比亚特区联邦检察官珍妮·皮罗 (Jeanine Pirro) 告诉特朗普总统，他的内政部长道格·布尔古姆 (Doug Burgum) 为自己的错误编造了一个自私的掩盖故事，误导了他。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/politics/trump-jeanine-pirro-showdown.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 05:03:29 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>中国不吸烟者试图消除误会，一次一场对抗</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/world/asia/china-cigarette-smoking.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着年轻一代越来越拒绝默默忍受二手烟，吸烟者和不吸烟者之间的争端变得越来越明显。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/world/asia/china-cigarette-smoking.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 04:00:05 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>亚利桑那州民主党州长将选择共和党竞选伙伴</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/elections/arizona-governor-running-mate.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[州长凯蒂·霍布斯 (Katie Hobbs) 陷入连任竞争，如果她在 11 月获胜，她计划任命亚利桑那州梅萨市温和派前市长约翰·贾尔斯 (John Giles) 担任副州长。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/elections/arizona-governor-running-mate.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 01:39:48 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
