    <item>
      <title>官员称他们已经找到了摧毁洛杉矶的火灾的原因</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/eaton-fire-cause-transmission-tower-report.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[官员称，2025 年伊顿火灾起因于南加州爱迪生公司一座闲置的塔楼，造成 19 人死亡并摧毁了阿尔塔迪纳社区。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/us/eaton-fire-cause-transmission-tower-report.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 23:07:39 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>由于股市担心伊朗和人工智能宽松，标准普尔 500 指数创下历史新高</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/stock-market-record.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[标准普尔 500 指数上涨 1.8%，突破 6 月初的前高点，并限制了近期科技股抛售带来的大幅好转。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/stock-market-record.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 22:05:38 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
